  "configuration": "Local synthetic best-effort product-sort explain-record persistence and explicit operator readback only. Background R2 writes have no durable response acknowledgement, retry/outbox, request idempotency, exactly-once or every-decision completeness guarantee; process termination/time limits/storage failure can lose scheduled receipts. Actual serialized receipts over1MiB are refused without truncation. One object per request increases listing/erasure workload; no deployed/native/runtime SLO or lift proof. Existing strict erasure barrier and generic rewrite reused, concurrent check/put race and full retention/history/deletion remain open. No full warehouse/customer/§1.6/W14/finding/gate/release acceptance. Existing signed authority, deterministic core and queue wire unchanged; selected pins not exhaustive runtime attestation. No external/cloud/credential/customer-data/deploy/build/install/commit/push operation.",
